WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Interviewer: Hi, thanks for joining. Can you introduce yourself briefly?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Candidate: Sure, I'm Alex. I have five years of experience in product engineering.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Interviewer: Great — tell me about a time you solved a hard bug.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Candidate: We had a race condition in our job queue system; I traced it to a shared cache and added locking to prevent concurrent writes.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Interviewer: How did you measure the improvement?

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:44.000
Candidate: We measured reduced job failures and saw a 40% drop in retries over two weeks.
